      "text": "ACADEMIC CURRICULUM VITAE\n\nDr. K. Thinakaran, MCA., M.Phil., M.E., UGC-NET, Ph.D.\n\n📞 Mobile: 98944 75486📧 Email: thina85@rediffmail.com\n\n1. PERSONAL DETAILS\n\nTotal Teaching Experience: 24 Years\n\nUGC-NET: Qualified (March 2013)\n\nHighest feedback from student\n\nWorked as a project, workshop, symposium and conference coordinator.\n\nBook published: Theory of Computation\n\n2. EDUCATIONAL QUALIFICATIONS\n\nDegree\n\nDiscipline\n\nUniversity / Institution\n\nYear of Completion\n\nPh.D\n\nComputer Science & Engineering\n\nAnna University\n\nOct-2017\n\nNET\n\nComputer Science\n\nUGC - NET\n\n2013 March\n\nM.E\n\nCSE\n\nMahendra Engineering College\n\n2009\n\nM.Phil\n\nComputer Science\n\nBharathiyar University\n\n2007\n\nMCA\n\nComputer Application\n\nSVN College, Madurai\n\n2001\n\nB.Sc Physics\n\nB.Sc Physics\n\nSVN College, Madurai\n\n1998\n\n3. TEACHING EXPERIENCE\n\nNo\n\nDesignation\n\nInstitution\n\nPeriod\n\n1\n\nProfessor \n\nSaveetha University\n\nJune 2019 – Till Date\n\n2\n\nAssistant Professor\n\nCrescent University\n\nJuly 2018 – June 2019\n\n3\n\nAssistant Professor\n\nHindustan Arts College\n\nOct 2015 – July 2018\n\n4\n\nAssociate Professor\n\nSVCET, Thirupachur\n\nJune 2012 – June 2015\n\n5\n\nAssistant Professor\n\nErode Sengunthar Engineering College\n\nJan 2007 – May 2012\n\n6\n\nLecturer\n\nPark Engineering College\n\nJune 2002 – Jan 2007\n\n\n\n4. SUBJECTS TAUGHT\n\nTheory of Computation\n\nDatabase Management Systems\n\nArtificial Intelligence\n\n C,C++ ,Python\n\nData Mining\n\nCompiler Design\n\nNetwork\n\nOperation System\n\n5. PUBLICATIONS\n\n(63 Paper indexed in  Scopus , H Index=12)\n\nSCI / SCIE \n\nAdvances in Computational Design – SCI-Expanded (SCIE)Thinakaran K.“Predicting the two-dimensional airfoil using machine learning methods,”Advances in Computational Design, 2020.\n\nElectronics (MDPI) – SCI-Expanded (SCIE)Selvi E., Adimoolam M., Karthi G., Thinakaran K.“Suspicious actions detection system using enhanced CNN and surveillance video,”Electronics, 2022.\n\nInternational Arab Journal of Information Technology (IAJIT) – SCI-Expanded (SCIE)Thinakaran K., Rajasekar R.“Hybrid algorithm with variants for feedforward neural network,”IAJIT, 2018.\n\nScopus Indexed\n\nH. Vardhan and K. Thinakaran, “Novel software effort estimation method using SVM Over Naive Bayes technique,” IEEE Xplore, 2022. [Online]. Available: https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9952158\n\nS. Rajeswari, S. Gokila, and K. Thinakaran, “Aspect based polarity extraction in Tamil tweets using tree-based recursive partitioning techniques,” International Journal of Engineering Trends and Technology, vol. 70, no. 12, pp. 421–430, Dec. 2022, ISSN: 2231-5381. https://doi.org/10.14445/22315381/IJETT-V70I12P240\n\nD. Sreekanth and K. Thinakaran, “Metro water fraudulent prediction in houses using convolutional neural network and recurrent neural network,” International Journal, vol. 11, no. 4, 2021, ISSN: 2237-0722.\n\nD. Shanmuga Sundaram and K. Thinakaran, “Intelligent approach for skin tumor finding and segmentation via bivariate shrinkage and speckle reducing anisotropic diffusion,” Annals of R.S.C.B., vol. 25, no. 5, pp. 743–768, 2021, ISSN: 1583-6258.\n\nK. Maithili, K. Thinakaran, and M. Adimoolam, “Efficient network resource allocation technique for dynamic IoT environment using reinforcement learning and CAT optimization,” Design Engineering, no. 7, pp. 11799–11815, 2021, ISSN: 0011-9342.\n\nM. Anand and K. Thinakaran, “Multiple metric based twofold route selection AODV routing protocol for improved communications on MANET for industrial automation,” Feb. 2021.\n\nL. Sathish Kumar, K. Thinakaran, and J. Mahalakshmi, “AlexNet approach for early stage Alzheimer’s disease detection from MRI brain images,” Materials Today: Proceedings, Apr. 2021.\n\nK. Thinakaran, “Predicting the two-dimensional airfoil using machine learning methods,” Advances in Computational Design, vol. 5, no. 3, 2020.\n\nK. Thinakaran and R. Rajasekar, “Hybrid algorithm with variants for feedforward neural network,” International Arab Journal of Information Technology, Mar. 2018, ISSN: 1683-3198.\n\nK. Thinakaran, “Hybrid neural network with modified cuckoo search via cluster technique,” International Journal of Engineering and Advanced Technology (IJEAT), vol. 8, no. 5, Jun. 2019, ISSN: 2249-8958.\n\nK. Thinakaran and R. Rajasekar, “Design of airfoil using backpropagation training with penalty term,” Journal of Theoretical and Applied Information Technology, vol. 65, no. 2, Jul. 2014, ISSN: 1992-8645.\n\nL. Sathish Kumar and K. Thinakaran, “Efficient approach of memory glow method for finding misplaced items,” International Journal of Scientific & Technology Research, vol. 9, no. 4, Apr. 2020.\n\nK. Santhi and K. Thinakaran, “Fuzzy logic based RAODV routing protocol,” International Journal of Recent Technology and Engineering (IJRTE), vol. 8, no. 4, Nov. 2019, ISSN: 2277-3878.\n\nSanthosh and K. Thinakaran, “Key based security on cloud storage,” Journal of Critical Reviews, vol. 7, no. 14, 2020, ISSN: 2394-5125.\n\nK. Thinakaran and Thulasikiran, “Improved allocation of virtual resources in cloud,” Journal of Critical Reviews, vol. 7, no. 14, 2020, ISSN: 2394-5125.\n\nE. Selvi, M. Adimoolam, G. Karthi, and K. Thinakaran, “Suspicious actions detection system using enhanced CNN and surveillance video,” Electronics (MDPI), vol. 11, p. 4210, 2022. https://doi.org/10.3390/electronics11244210\n\n\n\n6.  PROJECTS COMPLETION\n\nTitle\n\nAmount\n\nStatus\n\nCompany Name\n\nUser Interface for Firewall Configuration\n\n₹ 10,000\n\nCompleted\n\nInfonents System\n\n\n\n7. GUEST LECTURES(Acted as Resource Person)\n\nTOPC\n\nVenue\n\nDate\n\nFDP on “Machine Learning in Patient Care”\n\nSaveetha College of Nursing, SIMATS\n\n23rd  December 2025\n\n\n\nTheory of Computation\n\nDMI Engineering College\n\n29/9/2022\n\n\n\n8. ONLINE ACADEMIC CONTRIBUTIONS\n\n\n\nTopic\n\nLink\n\n1\n\nPDA  for a^nb^2n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/Nt5w5AOjAZM\n\n2\n\nCFG  for palindrome\n\nhttps://youtu.be/bz3Ycsr0bcI\n\n3\n\nDFA to Regular Expression using Arden’s Theorem\n\nhttps://youtu.be/CLSPRjE3Wyk\n\n4\n\nEpsilon NFA to NFA\n\nhttps://youtu.be/EYudzsy0wbI\n\n5\n\nMinimization of Automata\n\nhttps://youtu.be/yu0XcJhV_Hg\n\n6\n\nNFA to DFA\n\nhttps://youtu.be/02YUw315lUk\n\n\n\n\n\n9. Research  Ph.D Guided\n\nRegister number\n\nScholar Name\n\nTitle\n\nAwarded\n\n162003121\n\nV.GOPI KRISHNA\n\nDeep Learning Technique for Dermoscopy Image Processing Model for Early Melanoma Detection\n\n   FEB  2026\n\n162111005\n\nNandhini T J \n\nDesigning the novel method for crime scene object detection from surveillance video using deep learning model\n\n   Nov 2025\n\n162003150\n\nR KENNADY\n\nEnhancing Security and Efficiency of WSNThrough Trust-Based Routing and Optimization Models\n\n Thesis Submitted\n\n\n\n11. FDP Attended\n\nTopic\n\nOrganizer\n\nDate\n\nEMERGING TECHNOLOGIES FOR EDUCATION AND RESEARCH\n\nSree Sakthi Engineering College\n\n30.01.2023 to 01.02.2023\n\nMachine learning\n\nNARSIMHA REDDY ENGINEERING COLLEGE UGC AUTONOMOUS, ACCREDITED BY NBA & NAAC WITH A-GRADE Maisammaguda (V), Kompally, Secunderabad - 500100\n\n13.02.2023 to 18.02.2023\n\n\n\n12. Book Published\n\nSubject\n\nISBN\n\nPublished by\n\nTheory of Computation\n\n978-93-80406-58-9\n\nPallavi Publication,Erode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGuest Lecture\n\nDr. K. Thinakaran\n\nserved as a Resource Person in the Faculty Development Programme on“Machine Learning in Patient Care”\n\nheld on 23rd December 2024at Saveetha College of Nursing, SIMATS, Thandalam, Chennai.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nConference Coordination:\n\n\n\nSymposium Coordination:\n\n\n\n\n\nWorkshop\n\n\n\nBest Faculty Award\n\n\n\n\n\n",
